  "about": "I’ve spent 15 years helping games and the brands around them feel like something worth showing up for, from Call of Duty at Activision to The Last of Us at Naughty Dog and creator programs at Meta. I’ve been both a people manager and a hands-on maker, so I know the best work comes from how well people talk to each other, and bringing teams together is my favorite part of the job. Right now I’m at Riot Games on VALORANT, a bucket-list role that spans games and entertainment. I also consult through Levelwerk and Big House Consulting, helping brands of all sizes make a bigger impact with their audiences.",
